{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972720/extras/07e5f8c49a6dd1a98c24903eaec116a1.avif?t=1760360937\" width=1560 height=339 /></span><br><br>In the demo of <strong>Trenches VR</strong>, you will experience the opening of a World War I survival horror story. <br><br>Trapped in the claustrophobic trenches behind enemy lines, your goal is simple: <strong>escape.</strong> This demo lets you explore the atmosphere of the trenches, interact with the environment by cutting wires, and uncover scattered notes that provide a glimpse into the world and tone of the full game. Every step, every sound, and every decision matters as you get a taste of what it feels like to be a soldier struggling to survive in the horrors of WWI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972720/extras/56c272e1f8516b5258f8c72ba6623c98.poster.avif?t=1760360937\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972720/extras/56c272e1f8516b5258f8c72ba6623c98.webm?t=1760360937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972720/extras/56c272e1f8516b5258f8c72ba6623c98.mp4?t=1760360937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972720/extras/1c6f6034ad275f85dfe13065f5442f6d.poster.avif?t=1760360937\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972720/extras/1c6f6034ad275f85dfe13065f5442f6d.webm?t=1760360937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://sh